  "description": "Changes and improves the rails recipes, to make them more accessible to the player.",
  "body": "<center> \n\n![Railbalance_Banner](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/53552c7f14643d44c5a7c3c6160c50014a8ca1fe_0.webp)\n\n\n_**\"Because walking is for villagers\" - Steve**_\n\n<br>\nThis data pack places its focus on railbalancing the overall rail recipes, reducing the iron/gold amount per rail of the recipe, while adding other related items like sticks and redstone torches to some recipes, thanks to these slight changes your dreams of building a proper train station will become reality!\n<br><br>\n\n<br>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/organization/pixelforge\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/32237a5eb0e69b0cfb6f79b09d08bafae2139664.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/shadows_pixelforge\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6f8e5473c7cc891773d0963a204a7dbc0cae6ab8.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QrU6QCFj5r\"> \n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab1d9434d86f69f02be997775cc20d9f968fc6a6.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/shadowspixelforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fc15ed1de151999554a0a966e39ccaef439d6d4d.png\" alt=\"Twitch\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/shadowspixelforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2f10668a84476def0faf37c42319e0222484f94d.png\" alt=\"Instagram\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/shadowspixelforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b10f11429c9b97af2b45fcda64792d815fdeb5fb.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shadowspixelforge/projects\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6aa1b4a7d469617ce0e922b931c24e73ef48dc59.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3qlCr9lXguH44qq5xqAlzQ\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/74af846b0dabfde51cc50f295809ec96f63e26a2.png\" alt=\"Youtube\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://x.com/SPixelForge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eb699f87a889d2710efc5dcff9b6b023b2be2d58.png\" alt=\"X\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a>\n<br><br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c3c1204ae42e8889d824b47bdae198f98c3242a7.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2f227dd350f4e2322f500900863b7a6696b74f7.png\" alt=\"NO DEPENDENCIES REQUIRED\" width=\"660\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n  **This data pack works perfectly with Vanilla Minecraft - NO EXTRA MODS REQUIRED.** \n\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c3c1204ae42e8889d824b47bdae198f98c3242a7.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c7f3b2837c699bc40bda584b7d5781389c4dbe3d.png\" alt=\"MORE INTERESTING PROJECTS\" width=\"690\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellspacing=\"20\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/the-night-of-the-living-pumpkins\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/243c0c1904de2361e931432a6e0e5b0ee6b27e8f.png\" alt=\"The Night of the Living Pumpkins Icon\" width=\"200\"></a><br>\n      The Night of the <br> Living Pumpkins!\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/shadows-pixels-reforged\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/81c5b3f05c13dac83081221b58110365ada040c7_0.webp\" alt=\"Shadow's Pixels Reforged Icon\" width=\"200\"></a><br>\n      Shadow's Pixels Reforged <br>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/potion-recipes-vanilla-edition!\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5db9aeeeca92f223aeae14f2d48078dee1556f14.png\" alt=\"Potion Recipes: Vanilla Edition Icon\" width=\"200\"></a><br>\n      Potion Recipes: <br> Vanilla Edition\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c3c1204ae42e8889d824b47bdae198f98c3242a7.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5f88863218a1c549051bc37c2cbd07a395d1bdd2.png\" alt=\"YOUR SUPPORT MAKES THE DIFFERENCE\" width=\"850\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\nIf you like the content I make, don’t hesitate to join my Patreon or Ko-fi to enjoy all the exclusive members-only content, you'll get access to a lot of bonus content like WIPs, making ofs, dev. blogs and much more!\n<br>\n<br>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/shadows_pixelforge/tiers\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6dc8719629fd05f40aba4f4e58bc56458925abae.png\" alt=\"join ko-fi\" width=\"400\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shadowspixelforge/membership\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e73a4a0852508cb8d2b6a3dae2a42baef09334c0.png\" alt=\"join patreon\" width=\"400\" height=\"50\"> </a> \n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c3c1204ae42e8889d824b47bdae198f98c3242a7.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fb424f5c7e4031e9d8691616a446883413c75421.png\" alt=\"FAQs\" width=\"155\" height=\"50\">\n\n</center>\n<br>\n<br>\n\nHere I leave some answers to a few possible questions you may have, I hope it can help you.\n\n<details>\n  <summary>Frequently Asked Questions</summary>\n\n> **Q: Is Railbalance a Mod / Modpack / Resource Pack / Plugin...?**\n> \n> A: No, Railbalance is just a data pack and requires 0 dependencies, just Minecraft Vanilla!\n\n> **Q: Can you / Will you make a Bedrock port?**\n> \n> A: To make a version that would work on Bedrock, we would need to learn how Bedrock works. Unfurtunately, that's not something we plan to do any time soon for now, but it will come eventually.\n\n> **Q: Do you / Will you ever make a Mod?**\n> \n> A: For now we are mostly working on resource packs, follow us on ko-fi or patreon to stay up to date.\n\n> **Q: Can I put your Data Pack in my Modpack?**\n> \n> A: Yes, you can do it as long as you give us credit.\n\n\n</details>",
